{"type":"record","name":"BreakoutFeatures","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.breakout","doc":"Requirement FEA 06/07/10: the full feature snapshot retained for every episode decision (the forward training and audit corpus). Every feature is a typed nullable with its mask beside it; availability times respect the causal as-of rule. Stage 1 is non-actionable. emitted_time_ms is on the STREAM clock: the broker append time of the sequenced record that caused the output (deterministic under replay); the wall-clock publication time of the output is its Kafka record timestamp.","fields":[{"name":"episode_id","type":"string"},{"name":"instrument_id","type":"string"},{"name":"feature_version","type":"string","doc":"FEA 06: names the complete feature definition set; inference rejects an incompatible version."},{"name":"schema_version","type":"string"},{"name":"feature_event_time_ms","type":"long","doc":"The decision time: the episode's t0 (broker append time of the trigger record)."},{"name":"latest_input_available_time_ms","type":"long","doc":"FEA 10: the latest availability time among the inputs used; never after the feature event time."},{"name":"emitted_time_ms","type":"long","doc":"Service emission time on the stream clock: the append time of the sequenced record that caused this output. Equal to the decision time for an episode decision; a replay reproduces it exactly. Wall-clock publication time is the Kafka record timestamp."},{"name":"source_lineage","type":"string"},{"name":"strike_snapshot_id","type":"string"},{"name":"strike_snapshot_age_ms","type":"long","doc":"Decision time minus the snapshot cutoff."},{"name":"gamma_timestamp_policy","type":"string","doc":"DAT 08/DAT 10: how the gamma rows' availability was established. PRODUCER_STAMPED_UNVERIFIED = the producer's publication time on a topic whose Kafka timestamp policy is not verified as the broker's append clock (Stage 1 dev shadow: such inputs are quality-degraded, not trusted); BROKER_LOGAPPENDTIME_VERIFIED = the broker append time of a verified LogAppendTime topic.","default":"UNSPECIFIED"},{"name":"quality_status","type":{"type":"enum","name":"QualityStatus","symbols":["CLEAN","DEGRADED","EXCLUDED"]},"doc":"Same meaning as on the emission envelope: DEGRADED while the gamma inputs' timestamp policy is not a verified broker append clock (DAT 10).","default":"DEGRADED"},{"name":"gamma_input_age_ms","type":["null","long"],"doc":"FEA 06 input age: decision time minus the latest PUBLICATION (availability) time among the gamma rows the snapshot used.","default":null},{"name":"gamma_input_age_ms_mask","type":{"type":"enum","name":"FeatureMask","doc":"FEA 07: why a feature is absent. A null feature NEVER means zero exposure or balanced flow; the mask says whether it was not consumed in this stage, its input was missing or stale, the window was still warming up, or the producer masked it.","symbols":["AVAILABLE","NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1","INPUT_MISSING","INPUT_STALE","WARMUP","MASKED_BY_PRODUCER"],"default":"INPUT_MISSING"},"doc":"Mask of gamma_input_age_ms","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"price_history_age_ms","type":["null","long"],"doc":"FEA 06 input age: decision time minus the latest SPX price seen before the decision.","default":null},{"name":"price_history_age_ms_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of price_history_age_ms","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"lookback_snapshot_age_ms","type":["null","long"],"doc":"FEA 06 input age: decision time minus the cutoff of the older snapshot used for the causal change.","default":null},{"name":"lookback_snapshot_age_ms_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of lookback_snapshot_age_ms","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"price_history_coverage_ms","type":["null","long"],"doc":"FEA 05: how much of the session the rolling windows could draw on (decision time minus the first price of the session).","default":null},{"name":"price_history_coverage_ms_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of price_history_coverage_ms","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"direction","type":"int"},{"name":"strike_cents","type":"long"},{"name":"target_cents","type":"long"},{"name":"distance_to_strike_cents","type":"long","doc":"Unsigned distance from the trigger price to the monitored strike."},{"name":"distance_to_target_cents","type":"long","doc":"Unsigned distance from the trigger price to the target strike."},{"name":"snapshot_level_count","type":"int","doc":"Number of strike levels in the snapshot the selection used."},{"name":"time_of_day_ms","type":"long","doc":"Milliseconds since 09:30 America/New_York on the session day."},{"name":"time_to_close_ms","type":"long","doc":"Milliseconds until 16:00 America/New_York on the session day."},{"name":"strike_gamma","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Unsigned gamma magnitude of the monitored strike in the snapshot (dollars, unsigned: never signed dealer exposure).","default":null},{"name":"strike_gamma_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of strike_gamma","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"strike_gamma_share","type":["null","double"],"doc":"The strike's share of the unsigned gamma inside the selection's concentration window.","default":null},{"name":"strike_gamma_share_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of strike_gamma_share","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"neighbour_concentration","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Unsigned gamma within the concentration window around the strike divided by the snapshot total.","default":null},{"name":"neighbour_concentration_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of neighbour_concentration","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"target_strike_gamma","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Unsigned gamma magnitude of the target strike.","default":null},{"name":"target_strike_gamma_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of target_strike_gamma","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"strike_gamma_rank","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Rank of the monitored strike by unsigned gamma among the snapshot's strikes (1 is the largest).","default":null},{"name":"strike_gamma_rank_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of strike_gamma_rank","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"is_local_gamma_peak","type":["null","double"],"doc":"1.0 when the strike's gamma is at least that of both neighbouring levels, else 0.0.","default":null},{"name":"is_local_gamma_peak_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of is_local_gamma_peak","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"strike_gamma_change_60s","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Change of the strike's unsigned gamma against the latest snapshot at least 60 seconds older (causal).","default":null},{"name":"strike_gamma_change_60s_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of strike_gamma_change_60s","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"approach_speed_cents_per_s","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Signed price change per second over the approach window ending at the trigger (positive toward the strike).","default":null},{"name":"approach_speed_cents_per_s_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of approach_speed_cents_per_s","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"range_10m_cents","type":["null","double"],"doc":"High minus low of the eligible SPX prices of the prior ten minutes of the session.","default":null},{"name":"range_10m_cents_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of range_10m_cents","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"distance_from_session_high_cents","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Session high so far minus the trigger price.","default":null},{"name":"distance_from_session_high_cents_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of distance_from_session_high_cents","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"distance_from_session_low_cents","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Trigger price minus the session low so far.","default":null},{"name":"distance_from_session_low_cents_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of distance_from_session_low_cents","default":"INPUT_MISSING"},{"name":"es_delta_flow","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Causal ES delta flow (FEA 01): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"es_delta_flow_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of es_delta_flow","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"cumulative_volume_delta","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Cumulative volume delta (FEA 01): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"cumulative_volume_delta_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of cumulative_volume_delta","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"absorption_proxy","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Absorption proxy (FEA 02): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"absorption_proxy_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of absorption_proxy","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"vwap_distance_cents","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Distance to the ES-based VWAP (FEA 03): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"vwap_distance_cents_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of vwap_distance_cents","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"atm_iv_pct","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Producer atmIvPct (FEA 09): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"atm_iv_pct_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of atm_iv_pct","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"implied_minus_realised_pct","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Producer impliedMinusRealisedPct (FEA 09): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"implied_minus_realised_pct_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of implied_minus_realised_pct","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"net_vanna_exposure","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Scenario vanna exposure (GRK 03): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"net_vanna_exposure_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of net_vanna_exposure","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"net_charm_exposure","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Scenario charm exposure (GRK 03): not consumed in Stage 1","default":null},{"name":"net_charm_exposure_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of net_charm_exposure","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"gamma_flip_side","type":["null","double"],"doc":"FEA 09: +1 when the trigger price is above the locally computed gamma flip, -1 below. Needs a signed exposure scenario (GRK 04) not approved in Stage 1.","default":null},{"name":"gamma_flip_side_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of gamma_flip_side","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"realised_vol_pct","type":["null","double"],"doc":"FEA 09 producer field realisedVolPct: not consumed in Stage 1 (design-contract-only evidence until the Phase 0 interface table).","default":null},{"name":"realised_vol_pct_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of realised_vol_pct","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"iv_rv_trend_change_pct","type":["null","double"],"doc":"FEA 09 producer IvRvTrend change (the per-horizon columns are fixed by the Phase 0 interface table): not consumed in Stage 1.","default":null},{"name":"iv_rv_trend_change_pct_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of iv_rv_trend_change_pct","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"ivrv_warning_present","type":["null","double"],"doc":"FEA 09 producer per-type warnings state (1.0 when any warning is raised): not consumed in Stage 1.","default":null},{"name":"ivrv_warning_present_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of ivrv_warning_present","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"ivrv_grid_coverage","type":["null","double"],"doc":"FEA 09 producer gridCoverage: not consumed in Stage 1.","default":null},{"name":"ivrv_grid_coverage_mask","type":"FeatureMask","doc":"Mask of ivrv_grid_coverage","default":"NOT_CONSUMED_IN_STAGE_1"},{"name":"actionable","type":"boolean","default":false},{"name":"non_actionable_reason","type":{"type":"enum","name":"NonActionableReason","doc":"STG 05: why an output must not be acted on. Stage 1 has exactly one reason.","symbols":["MODEL_NOT_APPROVED"],"default":"MODEL_NOT_APPROVED"},"default":"MODEL_NOT_APPROVED"}]}